#OpenBMC D-bus 透過指令 busctl 探索 OpenBMC 底層的 D-Bus 物件路徑

步驟
1.透過SSH 連線到QEMU 模擬器中
  ssh root@localhost -p 2222
2.驗證環境是否在OpenBmc裡面
  cat /etc/os-release
✅ Result
ID=openbmc-phosphor 
NAME="Phosphor OpenBMC (Phosphor OpenBMC Project Reference Distro)" 
VERSION="3.1.0-dev"
VERSION_ID=3.1.0-dev-947-g80e2959a0b
VERSION_CODENAME="styhead"
PRETTY_NAME="Phosphor OpenBMC (Phosphor OpenBMC Project Reference Distro) 3.1.0-dev"
CPE_NAME="cpe:/o:openembedded:openbmc-phosphor:3.1.0-dev-947-g80e2959a0b"
BUILD_ID="20260816135335"
OPENBMC_TARGET_MACHINE="evb-ast2600"
EXTENDED_VERSION="3.1.0-dev-947-g80e2959a0b"

3.列出所有 D-Bus 服務
  busctl list

4.檢查特定的 D-Bus 服務狀態
  busctl status xyz.openbmc_project.State.Host

5.查看 BMC 狀態
  busctl get-property xyz.openbmc_project.State.BMC /xyz/openbmc_project/state/bmc0 xyz.openbmc_project.State.BMC CurrentBMCState

6.檢視指定物件底下的所有介面與屬性
  busctl introspect xyz.openbmc_project.State.Host /xyz/openbmc_project/state/host0
✅ Result
s "xyz.openbmc_project.State.BMC.BMCState.Quiesced"

7.讀取 D-Bus 物件的特定屬性數值
  busctl get-property xyz.openbmc_project.State.Host /xyz/openbmc_project/state/host0 xyz.openbmc_project.State.Host RequestedHostTransition
✅ Result
s "xyz.openbmc_project.State.Host.Transition.Off"

8.透過 D-Bus 發送方法呼叫（例如執行開機指令）
busctl call xyz.openbmc_project.State.Host /
xyz/openbmc_project/state/host0 xyz.openbmc_project.State.Host SetHostTransition s xyz.openbmc_project.State.Host.Transition.On

